r match, so it shows unchecked.",[353,363,364,365,367,368,344],{},"A native form submission sends ",[291,366,309],{}," instead of the browser's default ",[291,369,370],{},"on",[301,372,374],{"id":373},"label","Label",[288,376,377,379,380,383,384,344],{},[291,378,373],{}," defaults to \"Enable\" (\"啟用\" in Traditional Chinese), switching with the locale, and can be overridden with the ",[291,381,382],{},"checkbox.label"," text; see ",[340,385,47],{"href":386},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages",[346,388],{"name":389},"checkbox-label",[288,391,392,393,396],{},"The label shows on one line and is truncated when wider than its container. A tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[340,394,217],{"href":395},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press that shows the tooltip does not change the checked state.",[301,398,400],{"id":399},"description","Description",[288,402,403,405],{},[291,404,399],{}," shows below the label. Without a description, the height matches an input of the same size; with one, the checkbox grows and the description wraps, while the first line still lines up with fields next to it that have no description.",[346,407],{"name":408},"checkbox-description",[301,410,412],{"id":411},"color-and-icon","Color and icon",[288,414,415,416,334,419,422,423,344],{},"Uses the ",[291,417,418],{},"color",[291,420,421],{},"icon"," (the checked icon) of ",[291,424,425],{},"UCheckbox",[346,427],{"name":428},"checkbox-color",[301,430,432],{"id":431},"size-and-states","Size and states",[288,434,435,436,439],{},"The frame height matches an input of the same size. While loading, a spinner of the same size replaces the checkbox and it is disabled. See ",[340,437,102],{"href":438},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[346,441],{"name":442},"checkbox-states",[296,444,446],{"id":445},"examples","Examples",[301,448,450],{"id":449},"next-to-an-input","Next to an input",[288,452,453,454,457,458,461],{},"Inside a flex container, the wrapper shrinks with the available space and truncates the label. To show the full label, set ",[291,455,456],{},"ui.wrapper"," to ",[291,459,460],{},"shrink-0","; a label wider than the container is still truncated with a tooltip.",[346,463],{"name":464},"checkbox-inline",[301,466,468],{"id":467},"input-next-to-the-label","Input next to the label",[288,470,471,472,475,476,479,480,483,484,487,488,492],{},"Put an input next to the label with ",[291,473,474],{},"#append",". When the input is focused, call ",[291,477,478],{},"check()"," from the slot props to check the box too, and use ",[291,481,482],{},"labelId"," as the input's ",[291,485,486],{},"aria-labelledby",". Clicking non-interactive parts of the appended content does not change the checked state; see ",[340,489,491],{"href":490},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fchoice\u002Fcheckbox-group#item-append-content","Item append content"," for details.",[346,494],{"name":495},"checkbox-append",[301,497,499],{"id":498},"must-be-checked","Must be checked",[288,501,502,503,506,507,509,510,513],{},"For fields that must be checked, such as agreeing to terms, use ",[291,504,505],{},"v.check"," to check that the bound value equals ",[291,508,309],{}," (not ",[291,511,512],{},"v.literal",", which would narrow the UForm state type).",[346,515],{"name":516},"checkbox-validation",[296,518,520],{"id":519},"props","Props",[522,523],"component-props",{"name":524},"ShuoCheckbox",[288,526,527,528,531,532,535,536,535,539,535,542,535,545,334,548,551,552,554,555,557],{},"See ",[340,529,102],{"href":530},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#shared-props"," for the behavior of ",[291,533,534],{},"size",", ",[291,537,538],{},"disabled",[291,540,541],{},"loading",[291,543,544],{},"skeleton",[291,546,547],{},"id",[291,549,550],{},"name",". The default of ",[291,553,373],{}," can be overridden with the ",[291,556,382],{}," text.",[288,559,560,561,564,565,334,568,571,572,576],{},"Nuxt UI's ",[291,562,563],{},"variant"," (card), ",[291,566,567],{},"indicator",[291,569,570],{},"highlight"," are not supported, so that a frame does not make the option taller and break the height alignment with inputs; see ",[340,573,575],{"href":574},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#built-on-nuxt-ui","Built on Nuxt UI"," for why.",[296,578,580],{"id":579},"slots","Slots",[582,583,584,598],"table",{},[585,586,587],"thead",{},[588,589,590,594,596],"tr",{},[591,592,593],"th",{},"Slot",[591,595,520],{},[591,597,400],{},[599,600,601],"tbody",{},[588,602,603,609,620],{},[604,605,606],"td",{},[291,607,608],{},"append",[604,610,611,535,614,535,616,535,618],{},[291,612,613],{},"checked",[291,615,538],{},[291,617,482],{},[291,619,478],{},[604,621,622,623],{},"Content next to the label; see ",[340,624,491],{"href":490},[296,626,628],{"id":627},"styling","Styling",[288,630,631,634,635,637,638,645,646,649],{},[291,632,633],{},"ui"," accepts every slot of Nuxt UI ",[291,636,425],{},", merged as described in ",[340,639,641,642,644],{"href":640},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Ftheming#per-component-ui-prop","Per-component ",[291,643,633],{}," prop",", plus ",[291,647,648],{},"wrapper",":",[582,651,652,664],{},[585,653,654],{},[588,655,656,658,661],{},[591,657,593],{},[591,659,660],{},"Part",[591,662,663],{},"Built-in styles",[599,665,666,680,696,710],{},[588,667,668,672,675],{},[604,669,670],{},[291,671,648],{},[604,673,674],{},"Outer wrapper that measures truncation, holds the tooltip and positions the loading icon",[604,676,677],{},[291,678,679],{},"relative inline-flex w-fit max-w-full min-w-0 align-top",[588,681,682,687,690],{},[604,683,684],{},[291,685,686],{},"root",[604,688,689],{},"Checkbox frame (Nuxt UI)",[604,691,692,695],{},[291,693,694],{},"w-fit max-w-full min-w-0",", with height matching inputs of the same size and centered vertically",[588,697,698,702,705],{},[604,699,700],{},[291,701,373],{},[604,703,704],{},"Labe